        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|} \\hline \\text{Skor} & f & F_k \\\\ \\hline 30 - 39 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 40 - 49 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 50 - 59 & 8 & 13 \\\\ 60 - 69 & 14 & 27 \\\\ 70 - 79 & 10 & 37 \\\\ 80 - 89 & 3 & 40 \\\\ \\hline \\end{array}" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Data ke-10 berada di kelas 50–59. Tepi bawah $T_b = 49{,}5$; panjang kelas $p = 10$; $F_k$ sebelum = 5; $f = 8$." },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "Q_1 = 49{,}5 + 10 \\left( \\dfrac{10 - 5}{8} \\right) = 49{,}5 + 6{,}25 = 55{,}75" },
